        "func": "// Gop hai nguon: trang thai thiet bi tu ack, va so do song tu topic data.\nconst st = flow.get('dev_state') || {};\nconst lv = flow.get('live') || {};\n// Du lieu cu hon 15s thi noi thang la MAT LIEN LAC, dung hien so cu nhu so moi.\nlv.stale = !lv.seen || (Date.now() - lv.seen) > 15000;\nmsg.payload = { dev: st, live: lv };\nreturn msg;\n",
